<title>CANADA: Royal Plastics acquires Rubbermaid stake.</title>
<headline>Royal Plastics acquires Rubbermaid stake.</headline>
<dateline>TORONTO 1996-10-09</dateline>
<text>
<p>Royal Plastics Group Ltd said on Wednesday that it has acquired Rubbermaid Inc's 50 percent stake in joint-owned company Royal Rubbermaid Structures Ltd for an undisclosed price.</p>
<p>Royal Rubbermaid manufactures and markets vinyl garden storage sheds.</p>
<p>Royal Plastics said in a statement that it will rename the company Royal Outdoor Products Inc.</p>
<p>	  -- Reuters Toronto Bureau (416) 941-8100</p>
